9T01:50:56.071Z", "langs": ["en"], "text": "Maxey with another clutch 3 for the 76ers. \n\nThe kid really doesn\u2019t give a fuck that there are stars on his team\u2014he just plays in the state of Flow and shows no deference since he doesn\u2019t fall for the trap of perceiving those stars on his team as greater than him."}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 1, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T01:50:56.271Z", "labels": [], "threadgate": {"uri": "at://did:plc:xzgego6ufpxhkzmqxmrhsiv3/app.bsky.feed.threadgate/3myy5oljgfk23", "cid": "bafyreidpjdi3snk5ba4hx2py7475qmwzwr5lrhoiyauq4kduqnpltvandq", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.threadgate", "allow": [], "createdAt": "2026-10-29T01:50:56.082Z", "hiddenReplies": [], "post": "at://did:plc:xzgego6ufpxhkzmqxmrhsiv3/app.bsky.feed.post/3myy5oljgfk23"}, "lists": []}}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:l45hxnn4pk5t6sy3k7cau3eu/app.bsky.feed.post/3myy5nsrmj22u", "cid": "bafyreifak25ngpwfc3ut4l7sca3jevfwi7sz5ivev7xyxqmvu6x7pb2v7y", "author": {"did": "did:plc:l45hxnn4pk5t6sy3k7cau3eu", "handle": "fapshots.bsky.social", "displayName": "Fapshots", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:l45hxnn4pk5t6sy3k7cau3eu/bafkreia5hffq7wo6a6t2ha7b7a7gl4ujdputpgevixwxewbeeaqde46y24", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "following", "allowGroupInvites": "following"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [{"src": "did:plc:l45hxnn4pk5t6sy3k7cau3eu", "uri": "at://did:plc:l45hxnn4pk5t6sy3k7cau3eu/app.bsky.actor.profile/self", "cid": "bafyreiaxyu5bejvseurlohcbwr3ky4usuidykcxmlczhz3ggfdseeg3hry", "val": "!no-unauthenticated", "cts": "2024-11-05T19:26:44.366Z"}], "createdAt": "2024-11-05T19:26:46.782Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T01:50:30.125Z", "langs": ["en"], "text": "Historically, this is how series like this tend to play out. If one team is so much better, either it's a sweep, or the lesser team has to go above and be