description": ""}, "$type": "app.bsky.embed.external#view"}, "labels": [], "expiresAt": "2026-11-11T06:59:55.858Z", "isActive": false}}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T01:12:49.228Z", "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://www.nba.com/how-to-watch-game-redirect/0022600135?partnerRef=NBA&platform=Bluesky&surface=Post"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 294, "byteStart": 267}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "Pacers lead 76ers 88-75 after 3Q.\nIndiana outscored Philadelphia 36-13 in the third quarter.\n\nPascal Siakam: 20 PTS, 11 REB, 2 AST\nAndrew Nembhard: 14 PTS, 3 REB, 12 AST\n\nJaylen Brown: 18 PTS, 8 REB, 2 AST\nAnfernee Simons: 14 PTS, 2 REB, 4 3PM\n\n\ud83d\udcfa 4Q LIVE on ESPN: www.nba.com/how-to-watch..."}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 1, "likeCount": 14, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T01:12:50.574Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:xc32dedgv3ceunwz2nrseso4/app.bsky.feed.post/3myy4oczidsx2", "cid": "bafyreicgryabfzsnurzhdzrjvlpbsqhba7zftrdzu4dhurqzxxzgv56hya", "author": {"did": "did:plc:xc32dedgv3ceunwz2nrseso4", "handle": "upstract.com.web.brid.gy", "displayName": "Upstract [Unofficial]", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xc32dedgv3ceunwz2nrseso4/bafkreic343qlkf3svxfxxnshkbl7sj4vlwfemti4xrtt77gewa6lpqwcue", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "none"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [{"src": "did:plc:xc32dedgv3ceunwz2nrseso4", "uri": "at://did:plc:xc32dedgv3ceunwz2nrseso4/app.bsky.actor.profile/self", "cid": "bafyreialbn74hjbfwc4y6q52v2be2echs6lnlww4srykb4l7bfrzklumdq", "val": "bridged-from-bridgy-fed-web", "cts": "1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"}], "createdAt": "2025-03-21T14:03:47.243Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "bridgyOriginalText": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.upstract.com/ab56026ef05b98d6_sq.webp\" title=\"Jaylen Brown's Representative Reveals One Request He Made to Celtics Involving Jayson Tatum\" /></p><p>Jaylen Brown's representatives offered a new explanation of what the Philadelphia 76ers star wanted from the Boston Celtics.\nA representative for Brown told ESPN's Kris Rhim that Brown's only request after the Celtics informed him they planned to trade him was to have input on his destination. The\u2026</p>", "bridgyOriginalUrl": "https://upstract.com/x/ab56026ef05b98d6?ref=rss", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T01:12:34.000Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.external", "external": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.external#external", "description": "Jaylen Brown's representatives offered a new explanation of what the Philadelphia 76ers star wanted from the Boston Celtics. A representative for Brown told ESPN's Kris Rhim that Brown's only request after the Celtics informed him they planned to trade him was to have input on his destination. The\u2026", "title": "Jaylen Brown's Representative Reveals One Request He Made to Celtics Involving Jayson Tatum", "uri": "https://upstract.com/x/ab56026ef05b98d6?ref=rss"}}, "text": ""}, "embed": {"external": {"uri": "https://upstract.com/x/ab56026ef05b98d6?ref=rss", "title": "Jaylen Brown's Representative Reveals One Request He Made to Celtics Involving Jayson Tatum", "description": "Jaylen Brown's representatives offered a new explanation of what the Philadelphia 76ers star wanted from the Boston Celtics. A representative for Brown told ESPN's Kris Rhim that Brown's only request after the Celtics informed him they planned to trade him was to have input on his destination. The\u2026"}, "$type": "app.bsky.embed.external#view"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T01:32:54.473Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:mzpyicefyv6olrsxthlot7cb/app.bsky.feed.post/3myy36jnsqk27", "cid": "bafyreigkcwhtsgwie46rl7kclu6uvcmvcm7qdqgwtli7zduiuxwl3xlkwm", "author": {"did": "did:plc:mzpyicefyv6olrsxthlot7cb", "handle": "flyingwalruss.b